sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ERP as External ERP<br/>(School/Hospital)
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant MW as ApiKeyAuthMiddleware
    participant CTRL as EmployeesController /<br/>AttendanceController / LeaveController
    participant MED as MediatR<br/>(TenantIsolationBehavior)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>(Supabase, RLS)
    participant AUD as AuditBehavior

    ERP->>GW: POST /employees/sync<br/>X-Api-Key, X-Company-Id, employee JSON
    GW->>MW: forward request
    MW->>DB: lookup hashed key in api_keys
    DB-->>MW: key valid, bound to company_id
    MW->>MW: set ICurrentTenant.CompanyId<br/>set ClaimsPrincipal(Role=ApiClient)
    MW->>CTRL: request (tenant resolved)

    CTRL->>MED: SyncEmployeeCommand
    MED->>MED: inject companyId into command (TenantIsolationBehavior)
    MED->>DB: SELECT profile WHERE external_employee_id + company_id

    alt profile exists
        DB-->>MED: existing EmployeePayrollProfile
        MED->>DB: INSERT EmployeePayrollProfileHistory<br/>(copy old row, EffectiveTo = today)
        MED->>DB: UPDATE EmployeePayrollProfile (new values)
        MED->>DB: INSERT EmployeePayrollProfileHistory<br/>(new row, EffectiveFrom = today, EffectiveTo = null)
        MED-->>CTRL: action = "Updated"
    else no profile
        MED->>DB: INSERT EmployeePayrollProfile
        MED->>DB: INSERT EmployeePayrollProfileHistory (EffectiveFrom = today)
        MED-->>CTRL: action = "Created"
    end

    MED->>AUD: write AuditLog (EntityType=EmployeePayrollProfile)
    CTRL-->>ERP: 200 { success, profileId, action }

    Note over ERP,DB: Same shape applies to<br/>POST /attendance/sync and /leave/sync,<br/>except they upsert by IdempotencyKey<br/>and are REJECTED (409) if the period's<br/>PayrollRun is already past GENERATED (§13.4)
